      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 18:15 I was at the grocery; around 18:09 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:00 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:03 I passed through the square; around 22:09 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:13 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:19 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 18:15 I was at the grocery; around 18:14 I passed through the square; around 18:20 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:30 to 19:00 I was at home; around 19:07 I passed through Mill Road; around 19:13 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:14 I passed through the square; around 22:20 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:30 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
