      "key": "K0141",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 11:15 I was at home; around 11:16 I passed through the square; from about 11:15 to 23:00 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 23:03 I passed through the square; from about 23:00 to 11:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 11:09 I passed through the square; from about 11:15 to 23:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 23:13 I passed through the square; from about 23:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
