      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23, from about 09:00 I was at home; at the grocery from about 09:15; at the square from about 11:00; at the Drover's Rest from about 17:15; home around 21:15 and to bed; on Day 24 back at the grocery from about 08:15; home around 17:00; back at the Drover's Rest from about 18:15; home around 22:15 and to bed.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
