      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0247",
      "key": "K0248",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 09:15 I was at home; around 09:15 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 11:00 I was at the grocery; from about 11:00 to 17:15 I was at the square; from about 17:15 to 21:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 21:15 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:19 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 17:00 I was at the grocery; around 17:03 I passed through the square; from about 17:00 to 18:00 I was at home; around 18:06 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:17 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "arvid"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0249",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "Anton and I have never got on \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:anton"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "henrik",
       "viktor"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0250",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Henrik told me there's bad blood between them and Viktor \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:henrik",
       "person:viktor",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
