       "K0256",
       "K0257",
       "K0267",
       "K0284"
      ],
      "place": null,
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "From what I know and hear, Emil, Henrik and Viktor owe Agnes money \u2014 Emil is behind with it.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:agnes",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
