      "in": "K0351",
      "key": "K0352",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 17:00 I was at the workshop; around 17:03 I passed through the square; from about 17:00 to 18:00 I was at the grocery; around 18:04 I passed through the square; around 18:10 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:14 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:20 I passed through the square; from about 08:30 to 17:15 I was at the workshop; around 17:17 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at the grocery; around 18:10 I passed through the square; around 18:16 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
