      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23, from about 09:00 I was at the mill; at the grocery from about 14:30; home around 16:30 and to bed; at the Drover's Rest from about 21:15; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 24 back at the grocery from about 08:30; at the Okafor house from about 09:15; home around 10:15 and to bed; back at the Drover's Rest from about 17:15; home around 22:15 and to bed.",
      "time": 32220,
