      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0429",
      "key": "K0430",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 14:15 I was at the mill; around 14:20 I passed through Mill Road; around 14:26 I passed through the square; from about 14:30 to 16:15 I was at the grocery; around 16:16 I passed through the square; around 16:22 I passed through Mill Road; from about 16:30 to 21:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 21:10 I passed through Mill Road; around 21:16 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 22:00 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:06 I passed through the square; around 22:12 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:18 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:24 I passed through the square; from about 08:30 to 09:15 I was at the grocery; around 09:10 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 10:00 I was at the Okafor house; around 10:04 I passed through the square; around 10:10 I passed through Mill Road; from about 10:15 to 17:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 17:08 I passed through Mill Road; around 17:14 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 22:00 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:02 I passed through the square; around 22:08 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
