      "in": "K0535",
      "key": "K0536",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:13 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:19 I passed through the square; from about 16:30 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:15 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:10 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:07 I passed through the square; around 07:13 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 16:15 I was at the mill; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 16:18 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:24 I passed through the square; from about 16:30 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:09 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:00 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:02 I passed through the square; from about 22:00 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "emil",
       "henrik"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0537",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Emil told me there's bad blood between them and Henrik \u2014 an unpaid bill from last winter.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:emil",
       "person:henrik",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
