      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Drover's Rest, from about 19:00 to 22:00 on Day 24, I saw Agnes, Arvid, Emil, Henrik, Lena and Viktor, coming and going; Arvid, Emil and Lena were the worse for drink.",
      "time": 34259,
