      "text": "On Day 23, from about 09:00 I was at the grocery; home around 09:15 and to bed; at the Drover's Rest from about 16:15; home around 23:15 and to bed; on Day 24 back at the Drover's Rest from about 16:15; home around 23:15 and to bed.",
