      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 09:15 I was at the grocery; around 09:08 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 16:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 16:06 I passed through the square; from about 16:15 to 23:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 23:15 I passed through the square; from about 23:15 to 16:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 16:11 I passed through the square; from about 16:15 to 23:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 23:12 I passed through the square; from about 23:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
