      "in": "K0748",
      "key": "K0749",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 16:00 I was at the mill; around 16:04 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:06 I passed through the square; from about 16:00 to 17:15 I was at the clinic; around 17:10 I passed through the square; around 17:12 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at the Brandt house; around 18:10 I passed through Mill Road; around 18:12 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 19:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 19:09 I passed through the square; around 19:11 I passed through Mill Road; from about 19:15 to 20:15 I was at home; around 20:17 I passed through Mill Road; around 20:19 I passed through the square; from about 20:15 to 22:00 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:06 I passed through the square; around 22:12 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:07 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 16:15 I was at the mill; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 16:15 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:21 I passed through the square; from about 16:30 to 20:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 20:10 I passed through the square; around 20:12 I passed through Mill Road; from about 20:15 to 21:15 I was at home; around 21:10 I passed through Mill Road; around 21:12 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:17 I passed through the square; around 22:23 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:30 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
