      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23, from about 09:00 I was at the mill; home around 16:15; at the Drover's Rest from about 20:15; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 24 back at the mill from about 07:15; home around 16:15 and to bed; back at the Drover's Rest from about 21:00; home around 22:15 and to bed.",
