      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23, from about 09:00 I was at the grocery; at the clinic from about 09:15; at the Drover's Rest from about 17:15; home around 21:15 and to bed; on Day 24 back at the clinic from about 09:15; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; home around 17:15; back at the Drover's Rest from about 18:15; home around 22:15 and to bed.",
