      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 09:15 I was at the grocery; around 09:15 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:15 I was at the clinic; around 17:17 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 21:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 21:11 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 09:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 09:07 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:15 I was at the clinic; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 17:18 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:18 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:00 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:04 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
